<title>POLAND: PPABANK OCT NET SOARS TO PLN 1.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>PPABANK OCT NET SOARS TO PLN 1.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.99 vs    0.24</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.75 vs    0.56</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  4.07 vs    2.28</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 5.35 vs    3.11</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  7.02 vs    2.90</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   12.34 vs    5.54</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 33.53 vs   18.94</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	44.29 vs   27.04</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Pierwszy</p>
<p>Polsko-Amerykanski Bank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
